OK, if I'm understanding this correctly, you ARE able to level teleport, 
but can't control which level you teleport to.  This shouldn't happen
if you're using a ring of teleport control, so it looks like there are
two possibilities:

1) You forgot to put the ring on.  It won't do any good just
   sitting in your inventory.

2) The ring you think is a RoTC is really something else.  If you
   tried to get it with your wand of wishing and made a syntax
   error, it would have given you a random type of ring instead.

If you have positively identified the ring as a RoTC (with a scroll
or spell of identify) AND you are wearing it and it still doesn't
work, then something very weird is happening.

Hope that helped.

